  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/smol-machines/smolvm/zipball/v1.25.4",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Remove pack staging directories left behind by a killed pack by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1631\n* Refuse a rootfs extraction that lost sbin/init instead of booting it by @NickyHeC in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1228\n* Resolve a guest's DNS from the host so a blocked public resolver still works by @NickyHeC in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1226\n* agent: pull cold images through one crane process by @BABTUNA in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1523\n* CUDA fork: fix forking a CUDA golden failing with \"rebase guest RAM: Device or resource busy\" by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1373\n* Add host-mediated egress policy and decision protocol by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1434\n* Keep cache disk layers a branch still reads when collecting unused fork layers by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1633\n* Bump version to 1.25.4. by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1634\n* Keep machine execs alive when the image's workload exits by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1632\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.25.3...v1.25.4",
  "mentions_count": 3
